      "id": 5,
      "fact": "The Supreme Court granted certiorari in *Merrill Lynch, Pierce, Fenner & Smith, Inc. v. Manning* to resolve the division of authority among the lower courts regarding the scope of Section 27 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934.",
